        <name>getPreferredWidth</name>
        <qualifiedname>terminal::Dialog::getPreferredWidth</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns the preferred dialog width in logical pixels. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Derived from the rendered message text width (action-list name font) and the sum of button widths with horizontal padding. Whichever is wider determines the result, padded by <computeroutput>horizontalPadding</computeroutput> on each side.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Preferred width in pixels. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
