        <detaileddescription>
<para>Handles the case where the modal window is made visible after the component is already in the hierarchy. Uses <computeroutput>juce::MessageManager::callAsync</computeroutput> with a <computeroutput>SafePointer</computeroutput> to defer one message-loop tick, ensuring the native peer has fully realised focus before <computeroutput>grabKeyboardFocus</computeroutput> is called.</para>
